    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>Ren are tall, fine-boned Miraku whose hair often resembles layered feathers. Their movements are economical and precise, giving even a hurried Ren the appearance of perfect balance. They are renowned as diplomats, poets, ascetics and martial artists.</p>\n<p>Ren teachings emphasise the instant between intention and action. Their students learn to move before panic can take hold and to let wind carry away the force of a fall.</p>\n<p>You gain a +5 ft racial bonus to speed and a +5 racial bonus to initiative checks. Furthermore, when calculating damage or other consequences from a fall, treat the distance fallen as 20 feet shorter.</p>\n<p><em>Applied automatically:</em> +5 feet to your land Speed, a +5 racial bonus to Initiative, and every fall entered through the Falling action is treated as 20 feet shorter (the card says so).</p>",
